# FedoraKDE - live-media kickstart.
# Live media installs from the live image (liveimg payload): a %packages
# section is NOT allowed here.  All extra packages are installed by
# `install.sh provision` on first boot.
#
# When the OEMDRV partition is present, Anaconda picks this file up
# automatically; the install itself is started from the live desktop
# ("Install to Hard Drive").

